{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632240/extras/49fe281c437a3347d81f63a0d4c44d6d.avif?t=1771843019\" width=616 height=211 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twenty years after the devastating eruption of <strong>Mount Vesuvius in 79 AD</strong>, <strong>Pompeii</strong> rises from the ashes. As the head of a <strong>Roman family</strong>, you will guide the city's rebirth, shaping its future through politics, trade, and the challenges of life in the Empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632240/extras/76fae8e97068d847912bb556a7855f80.avif?t=1771843019\" width=616 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city may have been destroyed, but its spirit endures. <strong>Rebuild Pompeii</strong> from the ground up, balancing the needs of patricians, plebeians, and slaves, each with their own ambitions and grudges. Every street, forum, market, and aqueduct shapes not just the city, but the fortunes of your family for centuries to come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632240/extras/13449a91375d2d305fc7b7fc02fba2c3.poster.avif?t=1771843019\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632240/extras/13449a91375d2d305fc7b7fc02fba2c3.webm?t=1771843019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632240/extras/13449a91375d2d305fc7b7fc02fba2c3.mp4?t=1771843019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632240/extras/e99e730819a4aa4fcc61e061c65a80b2.avif?t=1771843019\" width=616 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Lead across decades, navigating the shifting tides of <strong>Roman politics</strong>. Shape laws, negotiate trade rights, and form alliances through marriage or contract. Secure favor with emperors, outwit rivals, and expand your family's influence far beyond Pompeii's walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632240/extras/60df50d1cc7ebc5977d493d56fc59d00.poster.avif?t=1771843019\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632240/extras/60df50d1cc7ebc5977d493d56fc59d00.webm?t=1771843019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632240/extras/60df50d1cc7ebc5977d493d56fc59d00.mp4?t=1771843019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632240/extras/c0c1e96cfff3118dbcce82c3a01c71dc.avif?t=1771843019\" width=616 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct housing, temples, arenas, and more to meet your citizens' needs. Establish trade routes across the Empire, monitor shifting markets, and keep your economy strong. Every decision, good or bad, can echo for generations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632240/extras/8cb5faef621e3c5cbc46e350254f4f37.poster.avif?t=1771843019\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632240/extras/8cb5faef621e3c5cbc46e350254f4f37.webm?t=1771843019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632240/extras/8cb5faef621e3c5cbc46e350254f4f37.mp4?t=1771843019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632240/extras/184b4898b4f286d973a0d77a242205c8.avif?t=1771843019\" width=616 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game incorporates active and passive bonuses through Family Bonuses, Research and Development, and Imperial Privileges. There are two main research branches: Technology and Philosophy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632240/extras/725c32703d1850a31c45a3bfbdcca7d5.poster.avif?t=1771843019\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632240/extras/725c32703d1850a31c45a3bfbdcca7d5.webm?t=1771843019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632240/extras/725c32703d1850a31c45a3bfbdcca7d5.mp4?t=1771843019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632240/extras/f733f40dbcddd1d990f5faef81ca5340.avif?t=1771843019\" width=616 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The greatest threats are not always on the battlefield. Earthquakes, fires, famine, plagues, and political sabotage can strike without warning. Some enemies will wear armor, others will smile as they shake your hand, all will test your leadership.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632240/extras/3fc48c7380a49e744aca3dfa56e55d70.poster.avif?t=1771843019\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632240/extras/3fc48c7380a49e744aca3dfa56e55d70.webm?t=1771843019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632240/extras/3fc48c7380a49e744aca3dfa56e55d70.mp4?t=1771843019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-financed by the Croatian Audiovisual Centre</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632240/extras/29023f93d96773e9d87fe390fd59b27b.avif?t=1771843019\" width=616 height=140 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"From Ash To Stone","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2632240/16b31f11761c07a8d4f1b18cc07eacfd75b53277.jpg"},{"name":"City Foundations","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2632240/48d6befe8051a719beef852d7345f2429a0612b4.jpg"},{"name":"People of Pompeii","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2632240/f78d3d85cdbd7f5d3761612e8c648c9961e75be0.jpg"},{"name":"Noble Society","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2632240/028af745724fc0dfe830ea456e168f6214ed38b3.jpg"},{"name":"Treasury of Pompeii","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2632240/91416306cf581e0c9821560aaab3c4af0aa0fe6b.jpg"},{"name":"Hunters of Pompeii","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2632240/b6505989682dca4bcebecc3cc7c54344b4c1c594.jpg"},{"name":"Bounty of the Bay","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2632240/a422da78a2a3e64119fe7e99a72e2e4f7d59013e.jpg"},{"name":"Roman Farmer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2632240/0339a6d39546528326eb8070b9b4ed88143f2125.jpg"},{"name":"Stone Age","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2632240/e0c77f3a1da9b09695b9fc39bebfe725f4897158.jpg"},{"name":"Lumber for Rome","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2632240/630c72aed3a8e356c4d6dfcbc5c057010711e6ef.jpg"}],"total":25},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2632240?t=1771843019","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632240/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771843019","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632240/f1e25d78bed9440f13e38c24a638a3971c894912/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771843019","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632240/f1e25d78bed9440f13e38c24a638a3971c894912/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771843019","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632240/extras/49fe281c437a3347d81f63a0d4c44d6d.avif?t=1771843019\" width=616 height=211 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twenty years after the devastating eruption of <strong>Mount Vesuvius in 79 AD</strong>, <strong>Pompeii</strong> rises from the ashes. As the head of a <strong>Roman family</strong>, you will guide the city's rebirth, shaping its future through politics, trade, and the challenges of life in the Empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632240/extras/76fae8e97068d847912bb556a7855f80.avif?t=1771843019\" width=616 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city may have been destroyed, but its spirit endures. <strong>Rebuild Pompeii</strong> from the ground up, balancing the needs of patricians, plebeians, and slaves, each with their own ambitions and grudges. Every street, forum, market, and aqueduct shapes not just the city, but the fortunes of your family for centuries to come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632240/extras/13449a91375d2d305fc7b7fc02fba2c3.poster.avif?t=1771843019\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632240/extras/13449a91375d2d305fc7b7fc02fba2c3.webm?t=1771843019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632240/extras/13449a91375d2d305fc7b7fc02fba2c3.mp4?t=1771843019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragr